# Settings -> Power off, the e-paper keeps the image, ENTER wakes (reset from System OFF).
boot
settle
press enter
press up
press up
press enter
press up         # POWER OFF
expect screen settings
press enter
settle
expect off
expect log power: system off
expect panel power_off.pbm
wait 30000
expect off
press enter
settle
expect on
expect log (reset 0x10000)
expect screen watchface
expect noerrors
